      "category": "Policy",
      "description": "Recommendation 1: In CA, do not bundle or deny a same-hospital unplanned readmission within 30 days of discharge when the index admission is a cesarean delivery, because obstetrical deliveries are exempt from the California 30 days readmission rule. Apply to CA. Exempt: obstetrical deliveries.\n\nRecommendation 2: For CA inpatient facility claims, apply PPC deny/bundle logic only when Y65.53, Y65.52, or Y65.51 is present on the same claim with POA under DRG/MS-DRG/PPC; exclude modifier PC and preserve the CA DVT/PE carve-out for pregnancy and under 21. Apply to CA. Exempt: modifier PC, CA: DVT/PE carve-out for pregnancy and under 21..",
